      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "CF4EFAFB6A2297A1",
      "text": "Spectre.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "769515401675C2CB",
      "text": "Vous n’étiez pas loin, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Il suffit\\nsimplement que l’eau passe à l’état solide.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_02",
      "hash64": "769516401675C47E",
      "text": "Splendide, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], c’est tout à fait ça ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_03",
      "hash64": "769517401675C631",
      "text": "Pas exactement... Mais il est vrai que les Pokémon\\nde type Spectre peuvent nous glacer le sang...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "BA108B3BD441BD5F",
      "text": "Le magnifique cristal brillant au-dessus de la tête\\nde monsieur Griknot désigne le type Glace.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_12",
      "hash64": "BA108C3BD441BF12",
      "text": "Ainsi, puisque monsieur Griknot est désormais\\ndu type Glace...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "BA108D3BD441C0C5",
      "text": "Les capacités de ce type ne seront pas très\\nefficaces contre lui, alors qu’en temps normal,\\r\\nleur puissance aurait été quadruplée !\\c\\nC’est non seulement fascinant, mais également\\nd’une grande utilité en combat ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 215,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "BA10863BD441B4E0",
      "text": "Par ailleurs, je souhaiterais développer le sujet\\ndes flocons de neige avec vous.\\c\\nSaviez-vous, par exemple, que malgré le grand\\nnombre de variétés de flocons, ils épousent\\r\\npresque tous la forme d’un hexagone ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 215,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "BA10873BD441B693",
      "text": "Ces hasards presque trop parfaits sont fascinants.\\c\\nEt ainsi tombent les flocons de neige dans\\nle ciel d’hiver, dansant au gré du vent.\\c\\nIndifférenciables à l’œil nu, et pourtant chacun\\nest parfaitement singulier...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 219,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "BA10883BD441B846",
      "text": "Ne ressentez-vous pas la présence des secrets\\nque renferme la nature qui nous entoure ?\\r\\nN’êtes-vous pas intrigués par ce grand mystère ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "BA10893BD441B9F9",
      "text": "Ahem...\\c\\nAu risque d’être hors sujet, les lunettes de\\nmonsieur Jacq ont aussi une forme d’hexagone...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_18",
      "hash64": "BA10923BD441C944",
      "text": "Oh... Où ai-je la tête ? J’ai oublié de vous dire\\nqu’il est possible de changer le type Téracristal\\r\\nd’un Pokémon au [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Trésor Culinaire[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], à Mezclamora.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_19",
      "hash64": "BA10933BD441CAF7",
      "text": "Néanmoins, la cheffe de cet établissement n’a\\npas un tempérament facile, dirons-nous.\\r\\nIl vous faudra gagner ses bonnes grâces.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_20",
      "hash64": "BA1A9C3BD44A2EC7",
      "text": "Bien, ce sera tout pour aujourd’hui.\\c\\nJe vous soumettrai à un contrôle partiel lors\\nde notre prochain cours !\\c\\nQuant à vous, monsieur Griknot, je vous remercie\\npour votre aide.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
